# Derived query cache — Parquet is BUILT from the committed CSVs at deploy/sync
# time (faster columnar reads for the API/DuckDB), never committed. The CSVs are
# the source of truth (and diff in git, giving us free revision history).
# See docs/format-contract.md and dev/build_parquet.R.
data/*.parquet
